; error: 10:13: 'xs' is given the place itself, to change its contents, so it needs a place that can change, and 'xs' never does (declared at 9:11); a value declared with 'flex' or 'bind' can

task change(bind& xs: [int]@r)
    xs[0] = 9
fi

task main()
    region r
    fixed xs = [1, 2, ...] at r
    change(&xs)
fi
